/* =====================================================================
 TradeLynin — main application (plain JavaScript, no build step)

 Globals are shared with logo.js / pwa.js / i18n-ar.js (classic scripts).
 Data lives in one object  D  persisted to localStorage key "tradelynin_v1":
   D.set settings · D.p products · D.c customers · D.s suppliers · D.g godowns
   D.sa sales · D.pu purchases · D.pay payments · D.ex expenses · D.st stock
   D.us users · D.ac cash/bank accounts · D.bin recycle bin · D.log audit log
 Views are functions on  V  (V.dash, V.sales, V.products ...) rendered by go().

 Section map (line numbers include this header):
   line   48  balances
   line   55  FIFO costing: replays all purchases/sales per product, oldest stock sells first
   line   76  ui helpers
   line   86  master data
   line  111  sale / purchase documents
   line  145  views
   line  213  bulk import (CSV)
   line  262  shell
   line  263  categories & units
   line  282  users, roles, audit, stock take, delivery note, share, excel
   line  303  statement PDF + WhatsApp reminders
   line  334  all transactions + day book
   line  361  stock movement, transfer history, dead / fast stock, filters
   line  385  cost preview on sale lines, customer prices, recycle bin, reorder list
   line  424  cash & bank accounts
 ===================================================================== */

